                                                   <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "Vulnerability | Definition of Vulnerability by Oxford Dictionary on Lexico.Com Also Meaning of Vulnerability. https://web.archive.org/web/20210118111731/https://www.lexico.com/en/definition/vulnerability. Accessed 19 Dec. 2022." ;
