                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "This is defined class. A Vulnerability is indexed by the interest_in object property. A disposition can be a Vulnerability according to one index and not a Vulnerability according to another index." ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vulnerability"@en ;
