###  https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001341
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001341> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000024> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Portion of Geosphere"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A fiat object part that is composed of one or more portions of the atmosphere, cryosphere, hydrosphere, or lithosphere."@en ;
