###  https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001628
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001628> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                            <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001235> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Yankee Time Zone"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Offset from Universal Coordinated Time = UTC-12"@en ,
                                                                                                   "Yankee Time Zone is the same local time as Mike Time Zone, but is 1 Day (i.e. 24 Hours) behind Mike Time Zone as they are on opposite sides of the International Date Line."@en ;
                                                   <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001753> "Y" ;
                                                   <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001760> "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/InformationEntityOntology"^^xsd:anyURI .


###  https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001629
<https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001629> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
