                                                   rdfs:label "Unix Time"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """Unix Time is a Temporal Reference System for describing a point in time, defined as the number of seconds that have elapsed since 00:00:00 Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) Thursday, 1 January 1970 minus the number of leap seconds that have taken place since then.
(See: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unix_time)"""@en ;
